					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/joysticknight" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7030142); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7030142&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606116927" alt="JoysticKnight" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7030142)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/joysticknight" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7030142); return false;" >JoysticKnight</a></span> <span class="odate time_1606107285 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">23 Nov 2020 04:54</span>
